双侧乳腺不对称，右侧略小，右乳皮肤增厚及凹陷改变，考虑术后改变；
右侧乳腺局限性致密并腺体牵拉 纠集，占位性病变及术后改变相鉴别，BI-RADS 4B类考虑，请结合临床及其他检查；
双乳小良性钙化灶，左侧乳腺X线摄影未发现明确恶性征象，BI-RADS 3类。
Asymmetric breasts, with the right side slightly smaller, thickened and indented skin on the right breast, considered postoperative changes;
Localized dense area in the right breast with glandular retraction, differential diagnosis of space-occupying lesion and postoperative changes, BI-RADS 4B is considered, please correlate with clinical and other examinations;
Small benign calcifications in both breasts, no definite malignant signs identified in the left breast on X-ray mammography, BI-RADS 3.

双肺下叶炎症并双侧胸腔少量积液，左侧为著，左下肺组织膨胀不全，请结合临床随访复查；
左肺下叶背段肺门旁实变影，Lung-RADS 4B类考虑，请结合临床病史，建议进一步检查明确；
双肺多发微、小结节, Lung-RADS 3类, 建议6月内随访复查；
右肺上叶前段纵隔旁纤维灶考虑；
纵隔淋巴结略增大；
主动脉多发钙化；
胸椎退行性改变。
肝实质多发低密度灶，性质待定，请结合临床病史及其他检查；
胆囊结石考虑。
Inflammation in the lower lobes of both lungs with a small amount of pleural effusion bilaterally, more prominent on the left side, with underinflation of the left lower lobe, please follow up with clinical review;
Solid shadows near the hilum in the posterior segment of the left lower lobe, Lung-RADS 4B considered, please correlate with clinical history, further investigation recommended;
Multiple micro and small nodules in both lungs, Lung-RADS 3, follow up within 6 months recommended;
Fibrotic foci near the mediastinum in the anterior segment of the right upper lobe considered;
Slightly enlarged mediastinal lymph nodes;
Multiple calcifications in the aorta;
Degenerative changes in the thoracic vertebrae;
Multiple low-density lesions in the liver parenchyma, nature to be determined, please correlate with clinical history and other investigations;
Cholelithiasis considered.

右肺下叶外、后基底段少许小片状胸膜下磨玻璃影，考虑轻度炎症可能，请结合临床；
右肺下叶背段胸膜下片状及索条样高密度影，胸膜略示粘连，考虑陈旧性及间质性病变；
左肺上、下叶纤维索条，考虑陈旧性改变；
双肺多发小结节, Lung-RADS 3类, 建议6月内随访复查；
气管憩室考虑；
双肺尖胸膜略增厚；
主动脉钙化；
胸椎退行性改变；
所见双肾多发囊肿考虑，请结合其他检查。

Small patchy subpleural ground glass opacities in the lateral and posterior basal segments of the right lower lobe, consider mild inflammation, please correlate with clinical findings;
Subpleural patchy and linear high-density shadows in the posterior basal segment of the right lower lobe, slight pleural adhesion, consider old and interstitial lesions;
Fibrous linear shadows in the upper and lower lobes of the left lung, consider old changes;
Multiple small nodules in both lungs, Lung-RADS category 3, follow-up within 6 months is recommended;
Consider tracheal diverticulum;
Slight thickening of the pleura in the apices of both lungs;
Calcification of the aorta;
Degenerative changes in the thoracic vertebrae;
Consider multiple cysts in both kidneys, please correlate with other examinations.

左肺上叶前段胸膜下实性结节， Lung-RADS 4A类考虑，建议3月内随访复查，必要时进一步检查；
双肺多发实性小结节, Lung-RADS 2类, 建议年度随访复查；
二尖瓣区片状金属密度影，术后改变？请结合临床病史；
主动脉轻度钙化；
胆囊结石考虑，请结合超声检查。
Solid nodule subpleurally in the anterior segment of the left upper lobe, Lung-RADS 4A category considered, follow-up within 3 months is recommended, further examination if necessary;
Multiple small solid nodules in bilateral lungs, Lung-RADS 2 category, annual follow-up is recommended;
Patchy metal density shadow in the mitral valve area, postoperative changes? Please correlate with clinical history;
Mild calcification of the aorta;
Cholelithiasis considered, please correlate with ultrasonography.

双肺多发实性小结节，与2025-3-7CT比较，右肺中叶内段新见实性结节，余小结节较前未见明显变化，Lung-RADS 3类，不除外炎性结节，请结合临床，建议6个月内继续年度低剂量胸部CT筛查；
右肺中叶纤维灶;
主气管右后方见囊袋样含气病变，气管憩室考虑.
